---
import { Picture } from "astro:assets";
import heroImage from "@/assets/4389.jpg";
import Link from "@/components/ui/link.astro";
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<main
  class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 place-items-center pt-16 pb-8 md:pt-12 md:pb-24">
  <div class="py-6 md:order-1 hidden md:block">
    <Picture
      src={heroImage}
      alt="Astronaut in the air"
      widths={[200, 400, 600]}
      sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 620px"
      loading="eager"
      format="avif"
    />
  </div>
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <h1
      class="text-5xl lg:text-6xl xl:text-7xl font-bold lg:tracking-tight xl:tracking-tighter">
      Hi Tech Soft Solution
    </h1>
 <p class="text-lg mt-4 text-slate-600 max-w-xl">
  A reliable business tool like Tally makes it easier to manage your daily
  accounting, keep track of finances, and stay in control of your business.
  As your business grows, your needs change too. That's why you need the
  right tools and support to handle new challenges, simplify everyday tasks,
  and keep your business running smoothly. With the right business solutions,
  you can save time, improve accuracy, and make better decisions. This helps
  you focus more on serving your customers, growing your business, and
  achieving long-term success.
</p>
    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
      <Link
        href="#"
        class="flex gap-1 items-center justify-center"
        rel="noopener">
        Read More
      </Link>
      <Link
        size="lg"
        style="outline"
        rel="noopener"
        href="contact"
        class="flex gap-1 items-center justify-center"
        >
        <Icon class="text-blue w-4 h-4" name="uil:phone" />
        Contact Us
      </Link>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

<style>
  @keyframes hero-text-enter {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(1rem);
    }

    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  .hero-copy > h1,
  .hero-copy > p,
  .hero-copy > div {
    animation: hero-text-enter 700ms ease-out both;
  }

  .hero-copy > p {
    animation-delay: 120ms;
  }

  .hero-copy > div {
    animation-delay: 240ms;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .hero-copy > h1,
    .hero-copy > p,
    .hero-copy > div {
      animation: none;
    }
  }
</style>
